92186133512 #edb/ref 1074 "To work out $\\left(-13\\right)^3,$ we multiply $-13$ by itself and then multiply the result by $-13$ again:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(-13)^{3} & =\\overset{169}{\\overset{⏞}{(-13)\\cdot (-13)}}\\cdot (-13) \\\\  & =169\\cdot (-13) \\\\  & =-2\\,197\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186133513 #edb/ref 1069 "e-13251" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186133513 #edb/ref 1071 "Find the value of $\\dfrac{3}{5}$ cubed." #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186133513 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "5468caae-f88a-59d2-98ab-7941bf7cd81a" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186133513 #edb/ref 1074 "To work out $\\left(\\dfrac{3}{5}\\right)^3,$ we multiply $\\dfrac{3}{5}$ by itself and then multiply the result by $\\dfrac{3}{5}$ again:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{(\\frac{3}{5})}^{3} & =\\frac{3}{5}\\cdot \\frac{3}{5}\\cdot \\frac{3}{5} \\\\  & =\\frac{3\\cdot 3\\cdot 3}{5\\cdot 5\\cdot 5} \\\\  & =\\frac{27}{125}\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186133514 #edb/ref 1069 "e-13253" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186133514 #edb/ref 1071 "What is the cube of $(-0.5)?$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186133514 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "ba7b4d05-42b6-58a5-9607-b30742991005" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186133514 #edb/ref 1074 "To work out $\\left(-0.5\\right)^3,$ we multiply $-0.5$ by itself and then multiply the result by $-0.5$ once more:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(-0.5)^{3} & =\\overset{0.25}{\\overset{⏞}{(-0.5)\\cdot (-0.5)}}\\cdot (-0.5) \\\\  & =0.25\\cdot (-0.5) \\\\  & =-0.125\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186133738 #edb/ref 1037 #edb/ref 17592186050428 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186133738 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186134411 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186133738 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186134570 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186133738 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186475924 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186133738 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186475985 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186133738 #edb/ref 1039 "Calculating th